PAGES={
'contact':('Contact Toolnest','Questions, corrections or a tool idea?',[('Get in touch',SUPPORT_EMAIL if SUPPORT_EMAIL else 'A public support contact has not been configured for this private preview. A real address is required before the public build can be enabled.'),('Help us reproduce a problem','Include the tool name, your browser and the steps that led to the issue. Do not send passwords, private documents or sensitive input data. Small made-up examples are usually enough to demonstrate a bug.')]),
'about':('About Toolnest','Small tools for the work in between.', [('Why this exists','Toolnest brings common text, image, development and calculation tasks into a simple browser toolkit. The first version focuses on tasks students and freelancers can complete without an account or installing software.'),('How the tools work','Calculations and transformations run in JavaScript on your device. Images are decoded and exported locally using the browser. Instructions explain the formulas and limitations so you can check whether a result fits your situation.'),('Quality and corrections','Every tool includes a worked example. Institution-specific grading rules, editorial style guides and file requirements can vary. Check important outputs against your own requirements. This is a private preview; an owner contact channel will be provided before public launch.')]),
'privacy':('Privacy','Your inputs stay in your browser.', [('Scope and tool inputs','This notice describes the current private preview, updated 21 October 2026. Text, images, generated passwords and calculation inputs are processed in your browser. The tool code does not upload those inputs, store them in a database or send them to an analytics service.'),('Hosting and access','The hosting platform may process request metadata, such as IP addresses, browser information and access logs, to deliver and secure the site. Private preview access may require authentication provided by the hosting platform. Those platform activities are separate from local tool processing.'),('Cookies, analytics and advertising','This version does not include site-added advertising or analytics scripts and does not add tool-specific cookies. Hosting authentication may use its own storage or cookies. If analytics or advertising is introduced, this notice and applicable consent controls must be updated before activation.'),('Files and clipboard','Downloaded files are saved by your browser. Copy buttons write to your device clipboard when you request it. Toolnest does not read your clipboard. Reloading closes the current in-memory work; downloads and clipboard contents are controlled by your device.'),('Contact','A public support and privacy contact will be added before this preview is opened to public visitors.')]),
'terms':('Terms of use','A few practical ground rules.', [('Using the tools','The current tools are free to use without a Toolnest account. You are responsible for checking that outputs are appropriate for your task. Keep original files before applying image transformations or text conversions.'),('Accuracy and limitations','Calculations follow the formulas described on each page. Browser rounding, image codec behavior and institutional policies may affect how a result should be interpreted. The tools are provided as available without a promise that every use case or browser will be supported.'),('Acceptable use','Use the tools only with content you are entitled to process. Do not attempt to disrupt the service, bypass hosting access controls or use the site unlawfully.'),('Changes','Tools and these terms may change as the site develops. This private-preview notice was updated on 21 October 2026. Public operator and contact details must be completed before launch.')])}
